  "strings": {
    "Bus timetables and live positions in Headway: data provided under license granted by City of Madison, WI, Metro Transit. Headway and Kitbag are independent of the City and Metro Transit.": {
      "comment": "Licences screen.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Headway のバスの時刻表とリアルタイム位置: City of Madison, WI, Metro Transit の許諾に基づき提供されたデータです．Headway と Kitbag は市および Metro Transit とは無関係です．"
